ind":"announcement","title":"Chocolate Parade","summary":"“The Ultimate Sweets’ Heavy-Weapons Zubabababa Battle!”Chocolate Parade is a chaotic roguelike action game where you roll around as sweets and blast away with heavy weapons! Play solo or in co-op, build your very own parade, and fight for coins on a battlefield where an all-out boss rush awaits!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T03:17:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656392472","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3844360-1840944183773451","game_id":"steam-3844360","kind":"update","title":"Chocolate Parade Demo — Update (2026.8.12)","summary":"Bug FixesFixed an issue where the Level 5 bonus was not applied to Waffle's machine gun.Fixed an issue where an effect would loop indefinitely if a shot hit the ground at the exact moment a battle ended.You can pick up the update from your Steam library. If you're in the middle of a session, please quit the game once and start it again.For bug reports and feedback, feel free to reach us on the Community Hub or on X (@choco_parade).","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-12T09:16:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183773451","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3844360-1840310314351084","game_id":"steam-3844360","kind":"update","title":"Chocolate Parade Demo — Update (2026.8.10)","summary":"Thank you to everyone playing the demo.Based on the feedback and reports we've received since launch, we've released an update focused on the parts that felt the most awkward to play.Quality-of-Life ImprovementsYou can now go back to the previous screen from the Difficulty Selection screen.No more returning all the way to the title screen when you want to pick again.Added support for high-resolution monitors and monitors wider than 16:9.If the display was breaking on an ultrawide setup, this upd","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-10T09:24:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314351084","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3844360-1840310314340694","game_id":"steam-3844360","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Out Now — Sweets With Heavy Weapons, Up to 3-Player Co-op","summary":"The demo for Chocolate Parade is out now on Steam, free to play.A chaotic brawl of sweets and heavy weaponry, wrapped up in a roguelike action game.About four minutes per run. Online co-op for up to three players.A chaotic brawl of sweets. Fast, replayable roguelike action in four-minute runsYou control a cast of adorable confections, defeating enemies and collecting coins to chase a high score. The controls are intuitive and each run takes about four minutes, so the pace keeps pulling you back ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-06T03:00:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314340694","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3844360":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:46:53Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T00:46:52Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3844360":"2026-10-26T00:46:53Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3844360":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:46:52Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:46:52Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4745470":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:46:53Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:46:53Z","status":"ok","e